    "...

Far out in the black mist, I saw a giant floating head wandering about. It stopped, then reached out with its arm from the fog and stabbed something into the ground. Then it twisted it into the ground with several motions. The giant released its grip, revealing the object to be a tall formation made of shadowy rock.

Deep violet plasma began to swirl on its surface before firing beams all around it. They held steadily on the",
// --
"numerous, helplessly paralyzed creatures nearby. Suddenly, they retracted back into the obelisk, and the giant absorbed the energy emanating from it.

